  "id": "molindone",
  "term": "molindone",
  "definition": "Molindone is an antipsychotic drug used for schizophrenia and other psychotic disorders, and it may also help with aggressive behavior in the undersocialized type of conduct disorder. It is an indole-derived medication with relatively low activity at dopamine, cholinergic, and alpha-adrenergic receptors compared with many other antipsychotics.",
